).
4. Response Mutation Strategy
Streaming Behavior [A]: Both GPT and Chron stream text by modifying the DOM in-place (appending text nodes or updating inner child tags within the active response container) rather than replacing the container node itself.
Lightweight Stabilization Signature [B]: Watch a tuple of (text_length, tail_content_hash) on the active response candidate node:
While streaming: L
t
